{"parse": {"title": "Imperial", "pageid": 64143, "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><span class=\"navigation-not-searchable\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><i>For the European team, see <a href=\"/counterstrike/The_Imperial\" title=\"The Imperial\">The Imperial</a>.</i></span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"navigation-not-searchable\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><i>For the Brazilian team, see <a href=\"/counterstrike/Imperial_Esports\" title=\"Imperial Esports\">Imperial Esports</a>.</i></span></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-container\" data-analytics-infobox-type=\"Cosmetic\" data-analytics-name=\"Infobox\"><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-wrapper infobox-counterstrike\"><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox\"><div><div class=\"infobox-header wiki-backgroundcolor-light\"><span class=\"infobox-buttons navigation-not-searchable\">&#91;<a class=\"internal text\" href=\"https://liquipedia.net/counterstrike/index.php?title=Imperial&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\">e</a>&#93;&#91;<a href=\"/counterstrike/Template:Infobox_finish\" title=\"Template:Infobox finish\">h</a>&#93;</span>Imperial</div></div><div class=\"infobox-image-wrapper\"><div class=\"infobox-image lightmode\"><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/counterstrike/File:Icon_inventory_p2000_imperial.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/commons/images/8/8c/Icon_inventory_p2000_imperial.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-image darkmode\"><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/counterstrike/File:Icon_inventory_p2000_imperial.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/commons/images/8/8c/Icon_inventory_p2000_imperial.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-header wiki-backgroundcolor-light infobox-header-2\">Information</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Wear levels:</div><div>Factory New - Battle-Scarred</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">StatTrak\u2122?:</div><div>Yes, all</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Souvenir?:</div><div>None</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Style:</div><div>Custom Paint Job</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-cell-2 infobox-description\">Created by:</div><div>Valve</div></div><div><div class=\"infobox-center\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/market/search/?appid=730&amp;q=Imperial\"><span class=\"buynow&#95;button buynow&#95;market\">Buy Now on Market</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-adbox\"><div class=\"content-ad-block navigation-not-searchable\"><div id=\"counterstrike_336x280_BTF\"></div></div></div><div></div></div><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-topcontent\"></div></div>\n<p><b>Imperial</b> is a weapon finish for the <a href=\"/counterstrike/P2000\" title=\"P2000\">P2000</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Available_weapons\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Available weapons</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Wear_levels\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Wear levels</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Available_weapons\">Available weapons</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/counterstrike/index.php?title=Imperial&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Available weapons\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#CF6A32\">Orange</span></b> and <b><span style=\"color:#FFD700;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;background-color:#000;\">yellow</span></b> borders indicate that the particular weapon can be obtained with this finish in <a href=\"/counterstrike/StatTrak%E2%84%A2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"StatTrak\u2122\">StatTrak\u2122</a> and <a href=\"/counterstrike/Souvenir\" title=\"Souvenir\">Souvenir</a> qualities, respectively.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Wear_levels\">Wear levels</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/counterstrike/index.php?title=Imperial&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Wear levels\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The graph below only represents the range of available wear levels; for most finishes, how common the different wear levels are defined by a bell curve (Field-Tested being the most common, Battle-Scarred and Factory New being the rarest, etc.)\n</p>\n<div style=\"width:661px; overflow:hidden\">\n<div style=\"font-size:85%;width:100%;height:18px;line-height:14px;\">\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:7px;height:16px;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:21px;text-align:right;\"><abbr title=\"Minimum amt. of wear\"><b>0%</b></abbr></div>\n    <div style=\"float:right;height:9px;width:516px;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"float:right;width:21px;height:16px;text-align:right;\"><abbr title=\"Maximum amt. of wear\"><b>20%</b></abbr></div>\n</div>\n <div style=\"height:8px;text-align:center;\">\n    <div style=\"float:left;height:7px;width:16px;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;height:7px;width:119px;border-right-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-top-left-radius: 2px; border-top-right-radius: 2px;border-color:#353535\"></div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;height:7px;width:25px;\"></div>\n</div>\n <div style=\"height:26px;text-align:center;line-height:24px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:2px;\">\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:24px;width:16px;background-color:transparent\"></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:24px;width:41px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-width:1px 0 1px 1px;background-color:#d5eebe\"><abbr title=\"Factory New\" style=\"text-shadow: 1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), 1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9);color:#FFF;\">FN</abbr></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:24px;width:47px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-width:1px 0 1px 1px;background-color:#c9e2b3\"><abbr title=\"Minimal Wear\" style=\"text-shadow: 1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), 1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9);color:#FFF;\">MW</abbr></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:24px;width:131px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-width:1px 0 1px 1px;background-color:#b8cfa2\"><abbr title=\"Field-Tested\" style=\"text-shadow: 1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), 1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9);color:#FFF;\">FT</abbr></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:24px;width:47px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-width:1px 0 1px 1px;background-color:#a4bb8d\"><abbr title=\"Well-Worn\" style=\"text-shadow: 1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), 1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9);color:#FFF;\">WW</abbr></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:24px;width:330px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-width:1px 0 1px 1px;background-color:#81976d\"><abbr title=\"Battle-Scarred\" style=\"text-shadow: 1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), 1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px -1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9), -1px 1px rgba(64, 64, 64, 0.9);color:#FFF;\">BS</abbr></div>\n</div>\n <div style=\"height:9px;text-align:center;\">\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:9px;width:16px;\"></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:9px;width:41px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-width:0 1px 0 1px;\"></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:9px;width:47px;\"></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:9px;width:131px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-width:0 1px 0 1px;\"></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:9px;width:47px;\"></div>\n   <div style=\"float:left;height:9px;width:329px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-width:0 1px 0 1px;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:85%;width:100%;height:18px;line-height:16px;\">\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:11px;background-color:transparent;height:18px;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:39px;background-color:transparent;\">0%</div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:46px;background-color:transparent;\">7%</div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:133px;background-color:transparent;\">15%</div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:47px;background-color:transparent;\">37%</div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:327px;background-color:transparent;\">45%</div>\n    <div style=\"float:left;width:25px;background-color:transparent;\">100%</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/counterstrike/index.php?title=Imperial&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: History\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class